<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In HiSAC: Hierarchical Sparse Activation Compression for Ultra-long Sequence Modeling in Recommenders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Matrix Formulation of Soft-Routing Attention</span></a></li>
